							LEFT OUTER JOIN SCM_ADM_LOOKUP_MASTER_DETAIL C  ON A.ITEM_ID = C.SEGMENT1 AND A.DIVISION_ID = C.SEGMENT3 AND C.LOOKUP_TYPE = 'SALES_PLAN_ITEM_ID' -- 20190906 Sales Plan에서 기타매출 등록한 것 제외
